THIRD-PARTY
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
The corpus in data/ contains outputs generated by Llama-3.3-70B,
Qwen-2.5-72B, DeepSeek-V3 and GPT-4o-mini, obtained through the OpenAI and
OpenRouter APIs. The CC BY 4.0 grant above covers the authors' selection,
arrangement and annotation of that material. Users who intend to redistribute
or build upon the raw generations should satisfy themselves that the relevant
model providers' terms permit their intended use; the authors make no
representation on that point.
